### Describe the bug

Here, in workers-rs ai.run, it calls `serde_wasm_bindgen::to_value`.

https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-rs/blob/bb141710ebcf38b5a61c6e8f1d1c20c3dd2f3f6d/worker/src/ai.rs#L26

